{
  "id": "lambdaber:dataset-foldem-uvra-dna-two-states",
  "title": "UvrA-DNA - two conformational states from 2,000 particles",
  "description": "Worked example of WorkflowOutputAssociation.conformational_state and number_of_particles: one particle_to_model_inference run whose two output models describe two states of UvrA on damaged DNA.",
